  "comments": "<p>Different Obverse and Reverse dies are known.<br><br><i>Obverse</i><br>Die <strong>1</strong> - bottom towers in corners lower, decorations in legend outlined.<br>Die <strong>2</strong> - bottom towers in corners higher, decorations in legend without outline.<br><br><i>Reverse</i><br>Die <strong>A</strong> - narrow script. Eight outer circle decorations connected with leaves.<br>Die <strong>B</strong> - bold script. No connection between eight outer circle decorations and leaves.<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/61669d9c631c4.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/61669d9c631c4.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><i>Combinations</i><br><strong>1</strong>+<strong>A</strong>: 1986- 1991.<br><strong>2</strong>+<strong>B</strong>: 1992-2001.</p>",
